<title>ARGENTINA: TABLE-Argentine monthly official crop projections.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Argentine monthly official crop projections.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Argentine government's Agriculture Secretariat issued the following 1996/97 crop production estimates (in tonnes) Thursday:</p>
<p>    Birdseed		  21,000</p>
<p>    Rice		   1,208,000</p>
<p>    Oats		     310,000</p>
<p>    Brewers' barley	441,000</p>
<p>    Forrage barley	   4,000</p>
<p>    Rye			 36,000</p>
<p>    Grain sorghum	2,496,000</p>
<p>    Maize		 14,699,000</p>
<p>    Millet		    52,000</p>
<p>    Wheat		 15,985,000</p>
<p>    Safflower		 15,000</p>
<p>    Rape			 4,000</p>
<p>    Sunflower seed     5,062,000</p>
<p>    Linseed		   72,000</p>
<p>    Peanuts		  265,000</p>
<p>    Soybeans	    11,009,000</p>
<p>    Beans		    287,000</p>
<p>    Cotton		 1,017,000</p>
<p>Total		     52,983,000</p>
<p>((--Jason Webb, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
